# This directory holds structured handoff reports written by each agent role.
#
# Files written here:
#   analyst-report.md   (if analyst role is introduced later)
#   developer-report.md
#   qa-report.md
#   reviewer-report.md
#
# Each report is overwritten at the start of each new task cycle.
# The Orchestrator reads these before deciding the next action.
# These files are the source of truth for inter-agent handoff — not conversation history.
